---
/**
 * Surface v2 canvas — ONE continuous full-bleed light-gray band wrapping
 * the body of a distilled article (the Apple shop register). Wrap all
 * canvas Sections in it: section headings live directly on the gray and
 * child blocks render as white tiles aligned to the inner grid. The hero
 * and sources stay outside on the white ground.
 */
---

<div class="article-canvas-wrap">
  <div class="article-canvas-body">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>
